      "content": "Grief can make even existing seem like a shadow, yet the desperate act of staying proves that the \"real\" you still cares enough to fight for something. While the old pain feels endless, choosing to pause and find professional support is often a way to stop the self-destruction and find a break from the performance. Please acknowledge that reaching out is not lying but the only honest step left when the world feels completely empty.",
